WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,470
What's going on

2
00:00:01,470 --> 00:00:04,790
Why is the steward's attitude towards the young master so cruel?

3
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:06,630
I have heard what happened yesterday

4
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:08,550
It’s okay for young people to learn from each other

5
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:10,390
But you have to pay attention to proportion

6
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:11,590
Disciple is urgent

7
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:14,230
The disciple’s family was seriously injured and unable to go to work

8
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:17,350
From now on, the daily work of the elixir garden will be arranged by you.

9
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:18,510
Stock source support

10
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:19,910
Fang Qingshan reliable

11
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,700
Thank you, steward

12
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,020
Disciple will definitely live up to his trust

13
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:27,760
Just arrange your daily errands

14
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:30,200
Of course you don’t have to report everything

15
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,000
Some spiritual vocations in the medicine garden

16
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,660
In addition to the monthly calendar, you can also pick it up yourself.

17
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,180
The disciple thanked the steward

18
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:42,330
The disciple resigned from the young master

19
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:43,530
Manager Qi didn't even punish us

20
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:45,090
Manager Qi’s mind is not on the medicine garden

21
00:00:45,090 --> 00:00:47,730
It was given to Tu Jiarong because he was the strongest and could convince everyone.

22
00:00:47,730 --> 00:00:50,130
Now that I have defeated him, he will naturally leave it to me. That’s how it is.

23
00:00:50,130 --> 00:00:52,010
We took over this position openly and honestly.

24
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:54,130
Come back to the medicine garden later. Be confident and don’t lose your share.

25
00:00:54,130 --> 00:00:56,530
The manager has said that the medicine garden will be under your control from now on.

26
00:00:56,530 --> 00:00:57,530
I'm optimistic about you
